## 1. API Endpoint Reference

### API #59 — Add Selection Round

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/add_job_round/:jobId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |
| **Rate Limit** | 50 req/min |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "round_name": "Aptitude Test",
  "round_description": "Online aptitude test covering quantitative, logical, and verbal",
  "round_type": "aptitude",
  "round_date": "2026-03-20T10:00:00",
  "round_venue": "Computer Lab - Block A, Room 201"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `round_name` | string | ✅ Yes | 2–200 chars |
| `round_description` | string | ❌ Optional | max 1000 chars |
| `round_type` | string | ❌ Optional | One of: `aptitude`, `technical`, `hr`, `group_discussion`, `coding`, `other` |
| `round_date` | ISO date | ❌ Optional | Valid ISO 8601 |
| `round_venue` | string | ❌ Optional | max 500 chars |

> [!NOTE]
> `round_number` is **auto-calculated** (MAX existing + 1). Do not send it in the request.

#### Success Response (201)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Selection round added",
  "data": {
    "round_id": "a1b2c3d4-...",
    "job_id": "e5f6g7h8-...",
    "round_number": 1,
    "round_name": "Aptitude Test",
    "round_description": "Online aptitude test covering quantitative, logical, and verbal",
    "round_type": "aptitude",
    "round_date": "2026-03-20T10:00:00.000Z",
    "round_venue": "Computer Lab - Block A, Room 201",
    "round_status": "pending",
    "created_at": "2026-03-04T05:30:00.000Z",
    "job_title": "Software Developer",
    "company_name": "TCS"
  }
}
```

#### Error Responses

| Status | Condition | Body |
|--------|-----------|------|
| 400 | Cancelled job | `{ "success": false, "error": "Cannot add rounds to a cancelled job" }` |
| 404 | Invalid jobId | `{ "success": false, "error": "Job posting not found" }` |
| 409 | Duplicate name | `{ "success": false, "error": "Round \"Aptitude Test\" already exists for this job" }` |
| 422 | Validation | `{ "success": false, "error": "Please check your input...", "details": [...] }` |

---

### API #60 — Update Round

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `PUT` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/update_round/:roundId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |

#### Request Body (at least 1 field required)

```json
{
  "round_name": "Online Aptitude Test",
  "round_date": "2026-03-22T14:00:00",
  "round_venue": "Online - HackerRank Platform"
}
```

All fields same as Add, but all optional. Must include at least one. Cannot edit `completed` or `cancelled` rounds.

#### Success Response (200)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Round details updated",
  "data": { "...same shape as add response..." }
}
```

#### Error Responses

| Status | Condition |
|--------|-----------|
| 400 | Cancelled job, completed/cancelled round, no fields |
| 404 | Invalid roundId |
| 409 | Duplicate name |

---

### API #61 — Update Round Status

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `PATCH` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/update_round_status/:roundId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "round_status": "in_progress"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Valid Values |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `round_status` | string | ✅ Yes | `pending`, `in_progress`, `completed`, `cancelled` |

#### Status Transition Rules

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> in_progress: Start round
    pending --> cancelled: Cancel
    in_progress --> completed: Finish round
    in_progress --> cancelled: Cancel
    
    note right of completed: Terminal state
    note right of cancelled: Terminal state
```

#### Success Response (200)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Round is now in progress",
  "data": { "...same shape as add response..." }
}
```

#### Error Responses

| Status | Condition | Example |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| 400 | Invalid transition | `"Cannot change round status from \"completed\" to \"pending\". Allowed transitions: none (terminal state)"` |
| 400 | Same status | `"Round is already \"in_progress\""` |
| 400 | Cancelled job | `"Cannot modify rounds in a cancelled job"` |
| 404 | Invalid roundId | `"Selection round not found"` |

