## 2. Frontend Implementation Guide

### Add Round Form

| Field | Input Type | Required | Validations |
|-------|-----------|----------|-------------|
| Round Name | **Single-line input** | ✅ | Required, 2–200 chars |
| Round Description | **Textarea** | ❌ | Max 1000 chars |
| Round Type | **Dropdown** | ❌ | Options: Aptitude, Technical, HR, Group Discussion, Coding, Other |
| Round Date | **Date-time picker** | ❌ | Must be valid date, preferably future |
| Round Venue | **Single-line input** | ❌ | Max 500 chars |

> [!TIP]
> Show the form as a **modal or slide-out panel** from the Job Detail page. After adding, refresh the rounds list on the parent page.

### Round Type Dropdown Values

```js
const ROUND_TYPE_OPTIONS = [
  { label: 'Aptitude', value: 'aptitude' },
  { label: 'Technical', value: 'technical' },
  { label: 'HR', value: 'hr' },
  { label: 'Group Discussion', value: 'group_discussion' },
  { label: 'Coding', value: 'coding' },
  { label: 'Other', value: 'other' },
];
```

### Round Status Badge Colors

```js
const STATUS_COLORS = {
  pending: { bg: '#FFF3CD', text: '#856404', label: 'Pending' },
  in_progress: { bg: '#CCE5FF', text: '#004085', label: 'In Progress' },
  completed: { bg: '#D4EDDA', text: '#155724', label: 'Completed' },
  cancelled: { bg: '#F8D7DA', text: '#721C24', label: 'Cancelled' },
};
```

### Update Round Form

Same fields as Add, but pre-filled with existing data. Show only for rounds that are `pending` or `in_progress`. Hide edit button for `completed`/`cancelled` rounds.

### Status Change UI

Use a **dropdown or button group** with only the allowed transitions for the current status:

| Current Status | Show Buttons |
|---------------|-------------|
| `pending` | "Start Round" → `in_progress`, "Cancel" → `cancelled` |
| `in_progress` | "Mark Complete" → `completed`, "Cancel" → `cancelled` |
| `completed` | *(no buttons — terminal)* |
| `cancelled` | *(no buttons — terminal)* |

