## 3. Integration Guide

### Relationship to Existing APIs

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Companies API] --> B[Job Postings API]
    B --> C[Job Positions API]
    B --> D[Job Eligibility Criteria API]
    B --> E["Job Rounds API ✨ NEW"]
    B --> F["Application Questions ❌ Future"]
    E --> G["Round Results ❌ Future"]
    G --> H["Placement Results ❌ Future"]
```

### Data Flow

1. **Create Job** (status: `draft`) → jobId returned
2. **Add Positions** to jobId
3. **Set Eligibility Criteria** for jobId
4. **Add Rounds** to jobId ← *this module*
5. **Publish Job** (validates: ≥1 position + criteria + ≥1 round exist)
6. Students apply...
7. **Process Round Results** (future) — uses `round_id` from this module

### Foreign Key Relationships

| Column | References | Cascade |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| `job_rounds.job_id` | `job_postings.job_id` | ON DELETE CASCADE |
| `student_round_results.round_id` | `job_rounds.round_id` | ON DELETE CASCADE |

### Frontend Navigation Pattern

```
Job List Page → Click Job → Job Detail Page
                              ├── Positions Tab
                              ├── Eligibility Tab
                              └── Rounds Tab  ← shows list + add/edit/status
```

### How This Supports Future APIs

| Future Module | How it uses Job Rounds |
|--------------|----------------------|
| **Round Results** | `round_id` FK — admin adds per-student results (passed/failed/absent) |
| **Student Applications** | Tracks `current_round_id` for each application |
| **Job Publishing** | Validates at least 1 round exists before publishing |

