## 5. Edge Case Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected |
|---|----------|----------|
| 1 | Add round to non-existent jobId | 404 |
| 2 | Add round to another college's job | 404 |
| 3 | Add round to cancelled job | 400 |
| 4 | Add round with duplicate name (case-insensitive) | 409 |
| 5 | Add round with only `round_name` (minimal) | 201 ✅ |
| 6 | Add round with invalid `round_type` | 422 |
| 7 | Update with empty body | 422 (min 1 field) |
| 8 | Update completed round | 400 |
| 9 | Update cancelled round | 400 |
| 10 | Change status `completed` → `pending` | 400 (terminal) |
| 11 | Change status `pending` → `completed` | 400 (must go through `in_progress`) |
| 12 | Change status to same value | 400 |
| 13 | Valid: `pending` → `in_progress` | 200 ✅ |
| 14 | Valid: `in_progress` → `completed` | 200 ✅ |
| 15 | Valid: `pending` → `cancelled` | 200 ✅ |
| 16 | Update round name to existing name in same job | 409 |
| 17 | Unauthorized role (TEACHER) | 403 |
| 18 | No auth token | 401 |
| 19 | Auto-incrementing `round_number` after adding 3 rounds | Expect 1, 2, 3 |
